    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of tactics in the Village Empires game! Here you have to manage both the entire army and individual units from a third-person perspective. In the game, you will be immersed in a gloomy atmosphere. You are surrounded by various enemies and other difficulties, and you will build an empire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features of the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Army and unit management: You will be able to control both entire troops and individual fighters, solving complex tasks and extracting unique resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Item Creation: The extracted resources can be used to create new items, which can then be mass-produced and used to strengthen your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Battles and tactics: To win, you need to destroy all the enemies on the map. Use your strategic skills and tactical techniques to defeat your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge and survive in this dangerous world? Then go to the dark times and test your survival skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of tactics in the Village Empires game! Here you have to manage both the entire army and individual units from a third-person perspective. In the game, you will be immersed in a gloomy atmosphere. You are surrounded by various enemies and other difficulties, and you will build an empire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features of the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Army and unit management: You will be able to control both entire troops and individual fighters, solving complex tasks and extracting unique resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Item Creation: The extracted resources can be used to create new items, which can then be mass-produced and used to strengthen your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Battles and tactics: To win, you need to destroy all the enemies on the map. Use your strategic skills and tactical techniques to defeat your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge and survive in this dangerous world? Then go to the dark times and test your survival skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
